       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SASBCEXP.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. AS400.

      **************************************************************
      *  SASBCEXP - COLLECT ASBESTOS EXPOSURE DATA SCREEN
      *     THIS SUB-PROGRAM IS CALLED WHENEVER A CRAFTSPERSON
      *     LEAVES OR CLOSES A WORKORDER (STOPS LABOR) TO DETERMINE
      *     IF EQUIPMENT ON WORKORDER IS FLAGGED FOR ASBESTOS.
      *     IF SO, THEN A SCREEN WILL BE DISPLAYED TO COLLECT
      *     DATA ON WHAT EVENTS HAPPENED WHILE THE CRAFTSPERSON
      *     WAS SIGNED ON TO THE WORKORDER.
      **************************************************************

       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.

       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZASBESTOS-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MEQPFILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSPLY-REC                   PIC X(2000).

       FD  MEQPFILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MEQPFILE-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0201.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  BASE                       PIC X(10).

       COPY CATREAD    OF COPYLIB.
       COPY TDATECHK   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGSUB    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CPYIND     OF COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK OF COPYLIB.
       COPY WSCONTROL  OF COPYLIB.
       COPY TBLOWUP    OF COPYLIB.
       COPY VCOMLINK   OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

       01  BUF-MEQPFILE.
           COPY MEQPFILE IN COPYLIB.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X     VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X     VALUE "0".

       01  SWITCHES.
           05  EOF-SW                    PIC X     VALUE "N".

       01  WS-DISPLAY-AREA.
           05    FILLER                  PIC XX.
           05  WS-DISPLAY-MSG            PIC X(27).
           05    FILLER                  PIC XX.
           05  WS-DISPLAY-STAT           PIC S9(4).
           05    FILLER                  PIC XX.
           05  WS-DISPLAY-FLD            PIC X(14).
           05    FILLER                  PIC XX.

       01  DEFAULT-MESSAGE               PIC X(79)  VALUE
            "PROBLEM WITH FUNCTION SELECTED.  TRY AGAIN".

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(80).

       01  WS-SCREEN.
           05  DISP-EQUIP-CODE           PIC X(06).
           05  DISP-WO-NUM               PIC X(10).
           05  DISP-LOCAL-NAME           PIC X(50).
           05  DISP-CORP-NAME            PIC X(50).
           05  DISP-PROC-REQ             PIC X(01).
           05  DISP-PROC-FOLW            PIC X(01).
           05  DISP-COMMAND-LINE         PIC X(79).
           05  DISP-MESSAGE-LINE         PIC X(79).

      ***************************************
      *     L I N K A G E  S E C T I O N    *
      ***************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  PASS-EQPNUM                   PIC X(06).
       01  PASS-WONUM                    PIC X(10).
       01  PASS-RESP                     PIC X(01).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING
                                 PASS-EQPNUM
                                 PASS-WONUM
                                 PASS-RESP.

       START-PROGRAM.
           PERFORM 1-HOUSEKEEPING THRU 1-EXIT.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN         THRU 6-EXIT
           PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB   THRU 2-EXIT.

       1-HOUSEKEEPING.
           MOVE "FEXPDATA" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE ZEROS  TO STATUS-AREA.
           MOVE ZEROS  TO FILE-STATUS.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-SCREEN.
           MOVE "N"    TO   EOF-SW.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN INPUT MEQPFILE.
           MOVE SPACES       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG.

           MOVE 1                        TO  DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.

       1-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       2-END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE MEQPFILE.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.
       2-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "SASBCEXP" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
             VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE SPACES TO MEQPFILE-REC.
           MOVE PASS-EQPNUM TO EQPNUM OF MEQPFILE-REC.
           START MEQPFILE KEY NOT < EQPNUM OF MEQPFILE-REC
             INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB THRU 2-EXIT.
           READ MEQPFILE NEXT INTO BUF-MEQPFILE
             AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB THRU 2-EXIT.
           IF EQP-EQUIP-NUM NOT = PASS-EQPNUM
              PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB THRU 2-EXIT.
           IF EQP-ASBESTOS-FLG = SPACES
              PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB THRU 2-EXIT.

      *-----EQUIPMENT FLAGGED FOR ASBESTOS, SET SCREEN FOR DISPLAY
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-SCREEN.
           MOVE PASS-EQPNUM      TO DISP-EQUIP-CODE.
           MOVE PASS-WONUM       TO DISP-WO-NUM.
           MOVE EQP-EQUIP-NAME   TO DISP-LOCAL-NAME.
           MOVE EQP-CORP-DESC    TO DISP-CORP-NAME.

       6-GET-REQ.
           MOVE WS-SCREEN TO DSPLY-REC.
           MOVE B"1" TO INDS (10).
           PERFORM 99-SCREEN-WRITE THRU 99-EXIT.
           PERFORM 98-SCREEN-READ  THRU 98-EXIT.
           MOVE DSPLY-REC TO WS-SCREEN.
           MOVE SPACES TO DISP-MESSAGE-LINE.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
              GO TO 6-GET-REQ.

           IF DISP-PROC-REQ = "Y" OR "N"
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
      *M****************************************************************
      *M   Message Set: 39   Number: 032
      *M  MUST ENTER 'Y' OR 'N'
      *M****************************************************************
              MOVE   39        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
              MOVE  032        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
              PERFORM  999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              PERFORM 9999-MOVE-CATREAD-MSG THRU 9999-EXIT
              GO TO 6-GET-REQ.

           IF DISP-PROC-REQ = "N"
              GO TO 6-EXIT.

       6-GET-FOLLOW.
           MOVE B"1" TO INDS (10) INDS (11).
           MOVE WS-SCREEN TO DSPLY-REC.
           PERFORM 99-SCREEN-WRITE THRU 99-EXIT.
           PERFORM 98-SCREEN-READ  THRU 98-EXIT.
           MOVE DSPLY-REC TO WS-SCREEN.
           MOVE SPACES TO DISP-MESSAGE-LINE.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
              GO TO 6-GET-FOLLOW.

           IF DISP-PROC-FOLW  = "Y" OR "N"
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
      *M****************************************************************
      *M   Message Set: 39   Number: 032
      *M  MUST ENTER 'Y' OR 'N'
      *M****************************************************************
              MOVE   39        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
              MOVE  032        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
              PERFORM  999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
              PERFORM 9999-MOVE-CATREAD-MSG THRU 9999-EXIT
              GO TO 6-GET-FOLLOW.
      *-----MOVE RESPONSE TO PROCEDURE FOLLOWED QUESTION TO RETURN
      *-----PARAMATER
              MOVE DISP-PROC-FOLW TO PASS-RESP.

       6-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       98-SCREEN-READ.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDICATORS ARE INDICS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO INDICS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
             MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
             MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
       98-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       99-SCREEN-WRITE.
           WRITE DSPLY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDICATORS ARE INDICS.
       99-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       999-CATREAD.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       9999-MOVE-CATREAD-MSG.
            MOVE B"1" TO INDS (99).
            IF CATREAD-MSG-TEXT = SPACES
               MOVE DEFAULT-MESSAGE TO DISP-MESSAGE-LINE
            ELSE
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER  TO DISP-MESSAGE-LINE
            END-IF.
            MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       9999-EXIT.
            EXIT.
